WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,120
That's almost it

2
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:09,090
This time the Fish King is more final than the previous ones.

3
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:14,940
What kind of fish is this damn fish?

4
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,220
Why are you so energetic?

5
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:23,180
It's Master Du

6
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,000
This kind of fish was named after salmon in later generations.

7
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,960
It is a high-end restaurant specially used to make sashimi.

8
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,360
In my previous life, I fished a lot with offshore fishing boats.

9
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,680
But that's all in the open sea

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,520
And I didn’t expect that I would also need to use large-scale fishing equipment.

11
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:35,800
I can actually be close to the pier

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,000
Just a few miles away

13
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,360
Get such a high-end house

14
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,480
Guess this fish

15
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:42,680
I picked it up because it was washed here by the waves at the bottom of the sea.

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,240
What Lao Yu was told was indeed right.

17
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,290
It’s easy to make a fortune during typhoon days

18
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,960
With this Du family division

19
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,600
Plus a cabin full of fish

20
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,240
This trip to sea was a complete success

21
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,040
There are fish purchased from Bifengang Fish Market

22
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,200
And there’s more than one

23
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:00,000
When we got there, we had three families

24
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,240
Find one with a reasonable price

25
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,920
Get rid of both Black Eagle and Du Shishi

26
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:04,600
It’s not even 1983 yet

27
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,480
Everywhere is in chaos

28
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:08,880
Especially when there is a lot of fish, you will have more ideas

29
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,200
The sea is no better than other places

30
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,760
If you meet a superstar

31
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,620
It would be dangerous to send good things like fish next time I go to sea.

32
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:16,740
You should bring a handful to open the mountain trail

33
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:17,980
Wait until conditions permit

34
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,180
Get another old fish cannon

35
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,460
Or Hanyang made body binding
